        "start": 0,
        "end": 2,
        "page": 2,
        "text": "方法",
        "line_tops": [
          969
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_block_index": 5,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "start": 0,
        "end": 53,
        "page": 2,
        "text": "用FDA接受的UVA/Padova模拟器构造30名虚拟1型糖尿病患者，每人模拟21种基础-餐时胰岛素方案：",
        "line_tops": [
